{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83e\udde9 Puzzle Box \u2013 A 10-in-1 Puzzle Collection!</strong><br>Puzzle Box is a complete <strong>collection of ten puzzle games</strong> packed into one value-filled bundle. From classic <strong>word games</strong> to exciting <strong>memory challenges</strong> and <strong>hidden object puzzles</strong>, there\u2019s something for everyone to enjoy. Test your brain, improve your problem-solving skills, and have hours of fun with this all-in-one <strong>puzzle collection</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With <strong>variety and replay value</strong>, Puzzle Box is perfect for both quick play sessions and long puzzle marathons. It\u2019s suitable for all ages \u2013 kids, teens, and adults will all find games they love inside this unique 10-in-1 package.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Includes 10 Puzzle Games:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0d <strong>Find Objects</strong> \u2013 Search and find hidden items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd20 <strong>Word Search</strong> \u2013 Discover hidden words in a grid</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde0 <strong>Rememberry</strong> \u2013 Test and train your memory</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uddbc\ufe0f <strong>Photo Puzzles HD</strong> \u2013 Classic picture puzzle fun</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Geo Quiz</strong> \u2013 Challenge your geography knowledge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd0e <strong>Spot It</strong> \u2013 Find ten hidden differences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u270f\ufe0f <strong>Word Ninja (Anagram)</strong> \u2013 Create words from letters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udddf <strong>Zombie Attack (Hangman)</strong> \u2013 Guess the hidden word</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd22 <strong>Find Numbers</strong> \u2013 Search for hidden numbers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb4 <strong>Match Pairs</strong> \u2013 Relax with a classic matching game</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2728 <strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae <strong>10 games in 1</strong> \u2013 no DLCs, all games are unlocked from the start</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udde9 <strong>Variety of puzzle types</strong>: word, memory, hidden object, trivia, matching</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Multiple difficulty levels</strong> \u2013 from beginner to expert</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf0d <strong>Travel the World</strong> \u2013 explore places and learn geography</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e <strong>Discover the Animal Kingdom</strong> with themed puzzles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u23f3 Thousands of levels to keep you entertained for hours</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc68\u200d\ud83d\udc69\u200d\ud83d\udc67 Fun for both kids and adults</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb6 Calming music, colorful HD photos, and cute characters</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 Beautiful graphics, modern design, and fun sound effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f Easy to pick up, relaxing to play, yet challenging to master</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1715950?t=1758625610","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1715950?t=1758625610","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715950/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758625610","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1715950/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758625610","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descrip